摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"J-Space Cognition Suite V3.6 - Inference-time cognitive control and deep reasoning plugin for DeepSeek Harness (DSH)","id":"gh:1338048389","install_available":true,"language":"Python","name":"dsh-plugin-j-space","slug":"kolawong/dsh-plugin-j-space","topics":["cognition","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","j-space"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"J-Space Cognition Suite V3.6 - Inference-time cognitive control and deep reasoning plugin for DeepSe"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"n Suite V3.6 - Inference-time cognitive control and deep reasoning plugin for DeepSeek Harness (DSH)"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# @custom/dsh-plugin-j-space"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文说明"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**J-Space Cognition Suite (V3.6)** is an inference-time cognitive control plugin designed for **Deep"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"Seek Harness (DSH)**. It enhances the reasoning fidelity, context persistence, and verification disc"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"ipline of LLMs (especially DeepSeek-V4-Pro / Flash and Kimi models) during complex, long-horizon tas"},{"id":"p4s4","text":"ine of LLMs (especially DeepSeek-V4-Pro / Flash and Kimi models) during complex, long-horizon tasks."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## 🌟 Why J-Space?"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"During long multi-step reasoning, coding, and autonomous workflows, large language models frequently"},{"id":"p6s2","text":" suffer from four major inference-time losses:\n1. **Working-Set Overload**: Too many active constrai"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"nts dilute attention.\n2. **Representation Drift**: Global invariants, architectural definitions, or "},{"id":"p6s4","text":"goals gradually mutate across steps.\n3. **Uncontrolled Retry**: Repeating failed routes without carr"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"ying diagnostic hypotheses.\n4. **Premature Completion**: Mistaking fluent conversational output for "},{"id":"p6s6","text":"otheses.\n4. **Premature Completion**: Mistaking fluent conversational output for verified execution."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"**J-Space** turns the model's accessible working memory into a structured, actively managed internal"},{"id":"p7s2","text":" workspace without changing model weights or requiring fine-tuning."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## ⚙️ 6 Core Cognitive Mechanisms"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| Module | Mechanism | Impact |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Broadcast Hub** | Shared constraints deri"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"ved once and broadcast | Prevents cross-file & cross-step representation drift |\n| **Dense Track** |"},{"id":"p9s3","text":" `✓ / ? / ✗` symbol registers with lossless plain-text expansion | Enforces stepwise falsification &"},{"id":"p9s4","text":" rigorous self-verification |\n| **Directed Focus** | Workspace limited to 1-2 active concepts | Elim"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"inates working-set cognitive overload |\n| **Bridge Reasoning** | Mandates intermediate bridging befo"},{"id":"p9s6","text":"re conclusion | Eliminates conclusion-first rationalization |\n| **Self-Monitoring** | Autonomously d"},{"id":"p9s7","text":"etects reasoning degeneration | Triggers rollback with explicit diagnosis |\n| **Workspace Ledger** |"},{"id":"p9s8","text":" Persistent state externalization (`jspace.py`) | Maintains durable memory across task seams & subag"},{"id":"p9s9","text":"stent state externalization (`jspace.py`) | Maintains durable memory across task seams & subagents |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## 🚀 Installation"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Compatible with all operating systems (**macOS**, **Linux**, **Windows**)."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### Method 1: DSH CLI (Recommended for Local & Server)"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Inside your DSH profile or project workspace, run:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### Method 2: Manual Setup (Local / Server / Container)"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"If you are cloning manually into your user directory (`~/.dsh`):"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"**macOS / Linux:**"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"**Windows (PowerShell):**"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## 🎛️ 4 Runtime Modes & Activation Policy"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"You can switch the operating mode in the DSH Web UI (**Settings ➔ Plugins ➔ J-Space**) or in `~/.dsh"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"he operating mode in the DSH Web UI (**Settings ➔ Plugins ➔ J-Space**) or in `~/.dsh/settings.yaml`:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"- **🎯 On Demand (`on-demand`) [Default]**: Automatically activated upon explicit user prompts or dur"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"ing complex multi-step reasoning.\n- **⚡ Always On (`always-on`)**: Global cognitive workspace inject"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"ed into every turn context.\n- **🤖 Auto (`auto`)**: Autonomously triggered based on task complexity a"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"nd code depth.\n- **⛔ Off (`off`)**: Completely disables the cognitive framework."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## 💬 Usage Examples"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"In DSH conversations or Taskboard AI drawer:"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"- **Implicit activation**: In `on-demand` mode, the model automatically loads `j-space` when you ask"},{"id":"p27s2","text":" for architecture refactoring, bug tracing, or theorem proving.\n- **Explicit trigger**:\n> *\"Use the "},{"id":"p27s3","text":"J-Space cognitive framework to plan and verify this database migration.\"*\n> *\"Activate J-Space Dense"},{"id":"p27s4","text":" Track to audit cross-file consistency for the auth module.\"*"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## 🌐 Internationalization (i18n)"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"The plugin UI card (`client.js`) features built-in automatic language detection (`English` / `中文`), "},{"id":"p29s2","text":"adapting automatically to your DSH locale and browser language without any configuration needed."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## 🔬 Scientific Background & Original Attribution"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"This project is built upon empirical research on language-model internal representations and package"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"s the original open-source J-Space Cognition Suite V3.6 by **Tiger3807861189** as a standard DeepSee"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"en-source J-Space Cognition Suite V3.6 by **Tiger3807861189** as a standard DeepSeek Harness plugin."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"### Scientific Foundation\n- *Gurnee et al., Anthropic (2026)* — Research on privileged internal repr"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"esentational workspace (\"poised-to-say\" representations)."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"### Citation"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"## 📄 License & Open Source Compliance"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"Licensed under the **Apache License, Version 2.0** (the \"License\")."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"- You may obtain a copy of the License at http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0.\n- Includes ups"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"tream work from `J-Space Cognition Suite V3.6` (c) 2026 Tiger3807861189.\n- See the LICENSE and NOTIC"},{"id":"p37s3","text":"E files for complete attribution details."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
